OL,3,GNEWSAJilted bride who went ahead with  
OL,4,Aher wedding alone finally walks down   
OL,5,Athe aisle                              
OL,7,FA bride who became a social media      
OL,8,Fsensation after being jilted at the    
OL,9,Faltar has described the "pure magic" of
OL,10,Ffinally walking down the aisle.        
OL,12,FKayley Stead's fiance did not turn up  
OL,13,Ffor her big day in 2022, but she       
OL,14,Fsurprised everyone by letting the      
OL,15,Fcelebration continue with many agreeing
OL,16,Fto "just go with this madness".        
OL,18,FFour years on and she has found love   
OL,19,Fagain, reconnecting with an old        
OL,20,Funiversity friend who did turn up for  
OL,21,Ftheir ceremony on Friday 13th November.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
